        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CDS1SMTSAL, C Shaped Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe C Shaped Door Pull Set comes packaged with 2 pulls meant to be mounted side-by-side on one side of a set of double doors. If you order back-to-back mounting, you will need to purchase 2 sets if you want a pull for each side of a set of double doors. This sleek C-Shaped pull is great for entry doors, shower doors, commercial doors, and storefront doors. It is made from aluminum in either either 6 inch or 12 inch overall lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions PR-CSD1SMTSAL C-Shaped Grip Door Pull Pair:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align =\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CSD04-specifications.pdf?v=1704262382\"><b>First Impressions PR-CSD1SMTSAL Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul> \r\n<b>FII-PR-CSD1006SMTSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .38\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-22/25\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PR-CSD1012SMTSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 10-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: .38\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-22/25\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.  Order one set for one side of one pair of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.   Order one set for one side of one pair of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>A pair of double doors requires 2 sets of pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 door pull handles). </i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "C Shape Pull Pair",
                "description": "The C Shaped Door Pull Set comes packaged with 2 pulls meant to be mounted side-by-side on one side of a set of double doors. If you order back-to-back mounting, you will need to purchase 2 sets if you want a pull for each side of a set of double doors. This sleek C-Shaped pull is great for entry doors, shower doors, commercial doors, and storefront doors. It is made from aluminum in either either 6 inch or 12 inch overall lengths.",
